mock_exam.question:
Application Task 5 (4 points): Whitebox – Branch Coverage: Consider the following code fragment:
```java
int f(int x, int y) {
    int r = 0;
    if (x > 0) {
        if (y == 0 || x > 5) {
            r = r + 10;
        }
        r = r + 1;
    } else {
        r = r - 1;
    }
    return r;
}
```
Specify the branches to be reached (true/false per if-statement) and provide concrete test inputs (x, y) that together achieve 100% branch coverage.
